            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.29.12+NUM.29.13+NUM.29.14+NUM.29.15+NUM.29.16+NUM.29.17+NUM.29.18+NUM.29.19+NUM.29.20+NUM.29.21+NUM.29.22+NUM.29.23+NUM.29.24+NUM.29.25+NUM.29.26+NUM.29.27+NUM.29.28+NUM.29.29+NUM.29.30+NUM.29.31+NUM.29.32+NUM.29.33+NUM.29.34+NUM.29.35+NUM.29.36+NUM.29.37+NUM.29.38"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 29.12-38",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi bagira ibirori byo kuziririza iminsi mikuru y'ingando nk'uko byanditswe, batamba ibitambo byoswa by'iminsi yose uko umubare wabyo wari uri, bakurikije itegeko ry'ibyategekewe umunsi wose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Kub 28.11—29.39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Hanyuma batamba igitambo cyoswa gitambwa ubudasiba n'ibitambo byo mu mboneko z'amezi, n'iby'ibirori by'Uwiteka byategetswe byose byejejwe, n'iby'umuntu wese washakaga gutura Uwiteka ituro, abitewe n'umutima ukunze. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku munsi wa mbere w'ukwezi kwa karindwi ni ho batangiriye gutambira Uwiteka ibitambo byoswa, ariko imfatiro z'urusengero zari zitarashingwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.3.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
