        },
        {
          "text": " Nuko ubwo abubatsi bashingaga urufatiro rw'urusengero rw'Uwiteka, bashyiraho abatambyi bambaye imyambaro yabo bafite amakondera, n'Abalewi bene Asafu bafite ibyuma bivuga, ngo basingize Uwiteka nk'uko Dawidi umwami wa Isirayeli yategetse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.3.10",
